# This repo is built and debugged from a unix toolchain (nasm/ld/gdb), even when
# the worktree lives on a Windows drive and is reached through WSL. core.autocrlf
# would otherwise hand gdb a CRLF .gdbinit and the shell CRLF scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.asm text eol=lf
*.inc text eol=lf
*.s   text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
.gdbinit text eol=lf
